# Optional WordPress.com test-site ID. Server-side only.
# Do not put real values in this file.
# WORDPRESS_SITE_ID=

# Do not store the OAuth access token in a Next.js .env / .env.local file.
# Shell and env-file loading can transform token characters.
# Save the raw token (no quotes, one line) in the gitignored file:
#   .wordpress-demo-token
# Then export it for the demo process as documented in docs/DEMO_RUN.md.
